              "width": 720,
              "content": "A native select draws its popup through macOS, so it ignored the palette entirely: white rows over a dark modal. Every picker in a card now opens this panel. Replacing a native control means re-earning what it gave for free, so it keeps the keyboard: arrows move the highlight, Enter commits, Escape closes, and the filter appears once a list runs past a dozen entries.",
