                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": 470,
                          "content": "History is read from the file Claude Code keeps on disk, so it exists for the fifteen providers that run on the claude binary. Codex, Gemini, Grok, OpenCode, Pi and Amp keep no such file, and Tars will not invent one out of the terminal. The live view is unaffected.",
