                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "The terminal keeps its size: the reason sits in the header, so a failed turn never resizes the pty, and the CLI's own line stays where it printed it. The branch and the mode marks come back when a new turn starts, which is also when the reason is cleared. The whole sentence is the title of the line, so hovering it reads the rest.",
